#terraform-aws-s3-website
This module creates a bucket S3 and a Cloudfront distribuition for a website, 
by default it creates an default origin but if you want to create a custom
origin the default origin will be removed. So, if you create any custom origin 
declare the all the origin, you can refer to default like the follow example:

cloudfront_custom_origins = [
    {
      domain_name         = module.my_module_name.bucket_demain_name
      origin_id           = "mywebsite.com.br"
    },
    {
      domain_name            = "api.mywebsite.com.br"
      origin_id              = "mywebsite.com.br"
      origin_protocol_policy = "match-viewer"
      origin_ssl_protocols   = ["TLSv1","TLSv1.1","TLSv1.2"]
    },  
  ]